iso:rel_105 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "4.2; Figure 4 (P)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-3" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "BRIDGE BETWEEN THE TWO BRANCHES. ISO 19650-3:2020, 4.2: the appointing party decides whether ISO 19650-2 applies to particular trigger events or assets; where both documents apply, responsibilities shall be established and communicated between the two appointing parties. Branch P of Part 3's Figure 4 is the case where the appointment follows a delivery phase using ISO 19650-2. Recorded in the Part 2 file because the project-side node is defined here." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_im_process_operational ;
    rdf:predicate iso:LINKED_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_im_process_delivery .

