    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-3" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Each task team generates information, in the work-in-progress state, in accordance with its TIDP; shall not exceed the required level of information need, extend beyond the allocated ICBS element, or duplicate information generated by other task teams." ;
