    rdf:subject iso:term_security_review .

iso:rel_634 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "4.6.2; 7.6.2" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "INTERPRETIVE: the list of significant changes compelling a security review at 4.6.2 (change of ownership, use or occupancy of a built asset; change of the processes or systems used to manage it; change in the information collected, processed or stored; change in the service delivered; change in the security context) overlaps substantially with the trigger event list of ISO 19650-3, A.3 (change in ownership, change in operator, change in maintainer, change in organizational requirements). Design consequence: a single operational event may have to trigger both the Part 3 information cycle and the Part 5 security review cycle." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_trigger_event ;
    rdf:predicate iso:CORRESPONDS_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_review .

iso:rel_635 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.6.2" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Event-driven reviews shall be undertaken following a review of the security strategy, UPON a security breach or incident, or when political, economic, social, organizational, technological, legal or environmental changes occur that can significantly impact the types of breaches or incidents that can occur, the process to be followed (including the need to collect forensic evidence), and business continuity measures and recovery actions." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_security_breach ;
    rdf:predicate iso:RESPONDS_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_review .

iso:rel_636 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1; Figure 2 (C)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    rdf:object iso:term_security_minded_approach ;
    rdf:predicate iso:PART_OF ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_management_plan .

iso:rel_637 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "Figure 1 (5, 6, B)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Figure 1 groups the security management plan with the asset management plan as coordinated and consistent plans; term_asset_management is reused without inventing an ISO 55000 plan definition." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_asset_management ;
    rdf:predicate iso:LINKED_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_management_plan .

iso:rel_638 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1.1" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "The security management plan enables the agreed mitigation measures set out IN the security strategy to be implemented in a consistent and holistic manner." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_security_strategy ;
    rdf:predicate iso:SPECIFIED_IN ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_management_plan .

iso:rel_639 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1.1; 7.1.3 a); 7.1.3 b)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "The plan's policies set out the security-related business rules DERIVED FROM the agreed mitigation measures, and its processes are in turn derived from those policies." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_security_risk_mitigation_measure ;
    rdf:predicate iso:RESPONDS_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_management_plan .

iso:rel_64 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "4.3" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-1" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "perspectives should be incorporated in the specification of information requirements, in the planning for information delivery, and in the delivery of information; defined case-by-case, the four in Table 1 recommended" ;
    rdf:object iso:term_information_requirement ;
    rdf:predicate iso:APPLIES_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:perspective_asset_user .

iso:rel_640 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1.3 c); Figure 1 (9)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    rdf:object iso:term_security_management_plan ;
    rdf:predicate iso:PART_OF ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_information_requirements .

iso:rel_641 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "Figure 1 (9, C)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Figure 1 places security information requirements (9) in the same group C, 'coordinated and consistent information requirements', as the AIR (8) and OIR (10) of ISO 19650-1. It is a fifth kind of information requirement alongside OIR/AIR/PIR/EIR, and the only one that RESTRICTS rather than DEMANDS information." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_information_requirement ;
    rdf:predicate iso:SUBTYPE_OF ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_information_requirements .

iso:rel_642 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1.3 c)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Details which information shall be regarded as sensitive, together with the policies and processes for its creation, distribution, use, storage, disposal and destruction." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_sensitive_information ;
    rdf:predicate iso:DESCRIBES ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_information_requirements .

iso:rel_643 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "Figure 1 (8, 9, C)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "PdM HOOK: Figure 1 requires the security information requirements and the asset information requirements to be CONSISTENT and COORDINATED with one another (group C). This is where the decision 'which condition data and telemetry are collected for predictive maintenance' has to be reconciled with the decision 'which data is classified as sensitive'. In practice the SIR acts as a filter applied over the AIR." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_air ;
    rdf:predicate iso:LINKED_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_information_requirements .

iso:rel_644 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "Figure 1 (9, 10, C)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Figure 1 group C. Note that Figure 1 also places 'asset operational use' (12) and 'performance measurement and improvement actions' (13) in group D - the operational-phase activities - as feedback sources into the OIR." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_oir ;
    rdf:predicate iso:LINKED_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_information_requirements .

iso:rel_645 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1.3 c)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "The policies and processes for the creation, distribution, use, storage, disposal and destruction of sensitive information apply at information container level." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_information_container ;
    rdf:predicate iso:GOVERNS ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_security_information_requirements .

iso:rel_646 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1.3 d); 7.2.1" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    rdf:object iso:term_security_management_plan ;
    rdf:predicate iso:PART_OF ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_third_party_information_provision_assessment .

iso:rel_647 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.2.3 b); C.3" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "The assessment shall consider whether the information, when aggregated with existing shared or published material, allows sensitive information to be deduced." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_information_aggregation_risk ;
    rdf:predicate iso:RESPONDS_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_third_party_information_provision_assessment .

iso:rel_648 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.2.3 c)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "PdM HOOK: the assessment shall consider, where applicable, whether the information contributes to determining the pattern-of-use of an asset and/or the pattern-of-life of individuals or groups/communities not otherwise publicly available." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_pattern_of_use ;
    rdf:predicate iso:RESPONDS_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_third_party_information_provision_assessment .

iso:rel_649 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.2.3 c)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    rdf:object iso:term_pattern_of_life ;
    rdf:predicate iso:RESPONDS_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_third_party_information_provision_assessment .

iso:rel_65 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "4.3" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-1" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "perspectives should be incorporated in the specification of information requirements, in the planning for information delivery, and in the delivery of information; defined case-by-case, the four in Table 1 recommended" ;
    rdf:object iso:term_information_requirement ;
    rdf:predicate iso:APPLIES_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:perspective_project_delivery .

iso:rel_650 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.2.1; 7.2.3" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "The assessment is required BEFORE sharing and/or publishing information or an information model, whether new, modified or existing, in whole or in part." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_information_model ;
    rdf:predicate iso:APPLIES_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_third_party_information_provision_assessment .

iso:rel_651 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "C.2.2; C.2.3" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Informative (Annex C)." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_third_party_information_provision_assessment ;
    rdf:predicate iso:PART_OF ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_information_redaction .

iso:rel_652 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "C.2.2" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Informative Annex C suggests hard copy, images or non-interactive PDF as protective formats instead of an interactive information model. This can reduce machine readability, so a PdM architecture should separate the protected external view from the authorized analytical source." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_information_model ;
    rdf:predicate iso:APPLIES_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_information_redaction .

iso:rel_653 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1.3 e); 7.3.1" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    rdf:object iso:term_security_management_plan ;
    rdf:predicate iso:PART_OF ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_logistical_security .

iso:rel_654 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.3.2 c)" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "The organization shall consider appropriate and proportionate measures to limit, or disrupt the success of, PHYSICAL hostile reconnaissance." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_hostile_reconnaissance ;
    rdf:predicate iso:RESPONDS_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_logistical_security .

iso:rel_655 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.3.1" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "Covers the specification, procurement, design, manufacture, transport, installation and commissioning of any sensitive asset - so it applies to the measuring devices and sensors installed for condition monitoring, not only to the asset being monitored." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_asset ;
    rdf:predicate iso:APPLIES_TO ;
    rdf:subject iso:term_logistical_security .

iso:rel_656 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "7.1.3 h); 7.5.1" ;
