iso:rel_664 a rdf:Statement ;
    iso:provenanceClause "8.4.3; 9.2.5" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:relationshipNote "8.4.3: relevant members of the delivery team shall be required to collaborate in the post-incident evaluation. 9.2.5: there shall be clear provisions in the appointment documentation for reporting a breach or incident caused by a professional advisor, contractor or appointed party, and for providing assistance in the investigation and follow-up actions." ;
    rdf:object iso:term_delivery_team ;
