    iso:definition "5x5 combination matrix (Table C.2) deriving the level of risk from likelihood and consequence: for Very high likelihood the level runs Moderate, High, Very high, Very high, Very high across increasing consequence; for High likelihood: Low, Moderate, High, Very high, Very high; for Moderate likelihood: Low, Moderate, Moderate, High, Very high; for Low likelihood: Very low, Low, Moderate, Moderate, High; for Very low likelihood: Very low, Very low, Low, Low, Moderate" ;
    iso:nodeId "term_risk_level_matrix" ;
    iso:part "ISO 19650-6" ;
    iso:pdmRelevance "high" ;
    iso:provenanceClause "Annex C; Table C.2" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-6" ;
    iso:sourceType "body_clause" .

