    iso:definition "information management activity 7, undertaken per appointment during the information production stage, in which each task team submits its information for lead appointed party authorization within the project's CDE, the lead appointed party reviews and authorizes (or rejects) the information model, each task team submits its information for appointing party acceptance, and the appointing party reviews and accepts (or rejects) the information model as a deliverable within the project's CDE" ;
    iso:nodeId "activity_information_model_delivery" ;
    iso:part "ISO 19650-2" ;
    iso:pdmRelevance "high" ;
    iso:provenanceClause "5.7; 5.7.5; Figure 3 (7); Figure 10" ;
