    iso:RESPONDS_TO iso:term_information_delivery_milestone ;
    iso:SERVES_PURPOSE iso:purpose_maintenance_repair,
        iso:purpose_operations ;
    iso:definition "exchange information requirements established by the appointing party to be met by the prospective lead appointed party during the appointment (5.2.1), and by the lead appointed party for each appointed party (5.4.3); shall establish the information requirements to be served during the appointment considering the OIR, AIR and PIR; the level of information need required to meet each information requirement; the acceptance criteria for each information requirement; the supporting information the prospective lead appointed party might need to fully understand or evaluate each information requirement or its acceptance criteria; and the dates, relative to the project's information delivery milestones and the appointing party's key decision points, that each requirement has to be met" ;
    iso:nodeId "term_eir_iso19650_2" ;
    iso:part "ISO 19650-2" ;
