    iso:SUPPORTS iso:term_safety,
        iso:term_security ;
    iso:definition "appropriate and proportionate, risk-based approach developed and implemented by the top management of the organization(s) where an initiative, project, asset, product or service has been determined to be sensitive in whole or in part and/or will be holding third-party information identified as sensitive; applied throughout the lifecycle of the initiative, project, asset, product or service, whether planned or existing, wherever sensitive information is obtained, created, processed and/or stored; comprises initiating the approach (Clause 5), a security strategy (Clause 6), a security management plan (Clause 7), a security breach/incident management plan (Clause 8) and measures for working with appointed parties (Clause 9)" ;
    iso:nodeId "term_security_minded_approach" ;
    iso:part "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:pdmRelevance "high" ;
    iso:provenanceClause "1; 4.9; Figure 2" ;
    iso:provenanceStandard "ISO 19650-5" ;
    iso:sourceType "body_clause" .

